    ("misconduct", "BrE /ˈmɪskɒndʌkt/", "AmE /mɪˈskɑndəkt/", "不当行为", "Misconduct findings follow the same standard as any disciplinary case.", "不当行为的认定遵循与任何纪律案件相同的标准。"),
    ("disciplinary procedure", "BrE /ˌdɪsəˈplɪnəri prəˌsiːdʒə(r)/", "AmE /ˈdɪsəpləˌnɛɹi pɹəˈsidʒɚ/", "纪律程序", "Disciplinary procedures must be independent of the alleged wrongdoer.", "纪律程序必须独立于被指控人。"),
    ("suspension from office", "BrE /səˈspenʃn frəm ˈɒfɪs/", "AmE /səˈspɛnʃən ˈfɹʌm ˈɔfɪs/", "停职", "Suspension from office is neutral in law and painful in practice.", "停职在法律上是中性的，在实践中是痛苦的。"),
    ("dismissal", "BrE /dɪsˈmɪsl/", "AmE /dɪˈsmɪsəl/", "解雇", "Dismissal requires both process and a fair reason.", "解雇既需要程序，也需要正当理由。"),
    ("regulatory engagement", "BrE /rɪˌɡjələtri ɪnˈɡeɪdʒmənt/", "AmE /ˈɹɛɡjələˌtɔɹi ɛˈnɡéɪdʒmənt/", "监管沟通", "Regulatory engagement happens early, or not at all.", "监管沟通要么趁早，要么就没有。"),
    ("openness", "BrE /ˈəʊpənnəs/", "AmE /ˈoʊpənnəs/", "坦诚；开放", "Openness to a regulator reduces the eventual severity of penalties.", "对监管机构的坦诚，会减轻最终的处罚严重性。"),
    ("cooperation", "BrE /kəʊˌɒpəˈreɪʃn/", "AmE /ˌkwɑpɚˈéɪʃən/", "合作", "Cooperation is credited at sentencing and rarely earlier.", "合作在量刑时才被记功，此前很少。"),
    ("self-reporting", "BrE /ˌself rəˈpɔːtɪŋ/", "AmE /ˈsɛlf ɹiˈpɔɹtɪŋ/", "主动报告", "Self-reporting triggers cooperation credit; silence triggers distrust.", "主动报告可获合作认定；沉默则招致不信任。"),
    ("enforcement notice", "BrE /ɪnˈfɔːsmənt ˈnəʊtɪs/", "AmE /ɛˈnfɔɹsmənt ˈnoʊtəs/", "执法通知", "Enforcement notices are published and stay online for years.", "执法通知会被公布，并在网上留存多年。"),
    ("settlement agreement", "BrE /ˈsetlmənt əˌɡriːmənt/", "AmE /ˈsɛtəlmənt əˈɡɹimənt/", "和解协议", "Settlement agreements with regulators usually include compliance undertakings.", "与监管机构达成的和解协议通常包含合规承诺。"),
    ("monitoring", "BrE /ˈmɒnɪtərɪŋ/", "AmE /ˈmɑnətɚɪŋ/", "监督执行", "Monitoring of consent orders is the regulator's way of returning once.", "对同意令的监督，是监管机构再次介入的方式。"),
    ("repeat breach", "BrE /rɪˌpiːt ˈbriːtʃ/", "AmE /ɹɪˈpit ˈbɹitʃ/", "重复违规", "Repeat breaches convert a warning into a different regulator.", "重复违规会把警示变成另一个监管机构。"),
    ("escalation protocol", "BrE /ˌeskəˈleɪʃn ˈprəʊtəkɒl/", "AmE /ˌɛskəˈléɪʃən ˈpɹoʊtəˌkɑl/", "升级处理规程", "Escalation protocols route bad news before it becomes a crisis.", "升级处理规程在坏消息演变为危机之前传递它。"),
    ("serious incident", "BrE /ˈsɪəriəs ˈɪnsɪdənt/", "AmE /ˈsɪɹiəs ˈɪnsədənt/", "严重事件", "Serious incidents are reported within hours, not at the next meeting.", "严重事件须在数小时内报告，而非下次会议时。"),
    ("near miss", "BrE /ˌnɪə ˈmɪs/", "AmE /ˈnɪɹ ˈmɪs/", "未遂事件", "Near misses are free information that nobody usually wants.", "未遂事件是免费信息，而通常没人想要。"),
    ("breach log", "BrE /briːtʃ lɒɡ/", "AmE /ˈbɹitʃ ˈlɔɡ/", "违规记录", "Breach logs reveal the same problem three times over.", "违规记录会揭示同一个问题重复三次。"),
